  designNotes: "Beat: the shot you have been taught is the wrong one. L2 says
    bring the post down. Nobody is garrisoned — a garrison dies in the
    collapse and would reward that shot. Six rifles stand in ONE rank
    (two groups of 3; one group of 6 hides a man behind the line). The
    post is empty until it falls. Then four rifles start at its near
    face and run out to the field. No banner. No wind. Soft on purpose."
